# Orchestra Project Conventions

- Never mention AI authorship or co-authorship in code, commits, or docs.
- All commit messages in English; keep them short with bullet points when needed.
- Code comments only for non-obvious implementation or business logic — not for the author.
- Document all API endpoints in Swagger.
- Shared types: use `Dto` suffix or `API` suffix (e.g. `TaskDto`, `UserAPI`).
- Frontend: API calls live in `services/`, not in components or hooks directly.
- Frontend styling: BEM naming, SCSS, design tokens in `styles/tokens/`.
- Backend: feature modules under `src/modules/`, Drizzle schema under `src/db/schema/`.
